@startuml
title UC22 - Trình tự Gửi tin nhắn chat
actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Chat Panel (UI)" as UI
participant "ChatController (client)" as ChatCli
participant "WebSocketClient" as WS
participant "SignalingEndpoint (server)" as Signal
participant "MessageService (server)" as MsgSvc
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> UI: Nhập nội dung + Gửi
UI -> ChatCli: onSend(text)
ChatCli -> UI: Hiển thị tạm (optimistic)
ChatCli -> WS: send chat(text)
WS -> Signal: chat(text, roomId)
Signal -> MsgSvc: saveMessage(roomId, senderId, text)
MsgSvc -> DB: INSERT messages
DB --> MsgSvc: messageId
MsgSvc --> Signal: ChatSaved(messageId)
Signal -> WS: broadcast chat(messageId, text, sender)
WS -> ChatCli: onMessage(chat)
ChatCli -> UI: Đồng bộ messageId / auto-scroll
@enduml